## Article 96. Financial Penalties (Fines)

```catala
declaration scope Article96Fines:
  input applicantType content ApplicantType
  output minFineNMGD content integer
  output maxFineNMGD content integer

scope Article96Fines:
  label default_min definition minFineNMGD equals 0
  label default_max definition maxFineNMGD equals 0
  
  label physical_person_min exception default_min
  definition minFineNMGD under condition 
    applicantType = PhysicalPerson 
    consequence equals 70
  
  label physical_person_max exception default_max
  definition maxFineNMGD under condition 
    applicantType = PhysicalPerson 
    consequence equals 530
  
  label legal_entity_min exception default_min
  definition minFineNMGD under condition 
    applicantType = LegalEntityOrEntrepreneur 
    consequence equals 175
  
  label legal_entity_max exception default_max
  definition maxFineNMGD under condition 
    applicantType = LegalEntityOrEntrepreneur 
    consequence equals 1765
```
